==Notes==
*Added in [[patch]] 1.67.

===Previous versions===
*Prior to Neverwinter Nights: Enhanced Edition, [[Weapon focus]] in the trident was ineffective in combat. (The bonus to attack was not used.).
*Prior to version 1.69, no trident-specific feats (''weapon focus'', [[weapon specialization]], etc.) existed.
*Prior to version 1.69, the trident was a simple, not martial, weapon.